<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Jan current account deficit falls.</title>
<headline>Portugal Jan current account deficit falls.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's current account deficit fell to 41.4 billion escudos in January 1997 from 43.1 billion in January 1996, the Bank of Portugal said in a monthly report.</p>
</text>
